  "solution": "Cường độ của lực <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>15</mn></semantics></math>(N).<br>Độ dài quãng đường là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>120</mn></semantics></math>(m).<br>Góc giữa véc-tơ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> và hướng di chuyển là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy công sinh bởi lực <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>1559</mn></mrow></semantics></math>(N).",
